## Photographs.
## This repo is public. Camera-native and large formats are blanket-ignored
## because they never legitimately belong in the source tree.
*.[Cc][Rr]2
*.[Cc][Rr]3
*.[Nn][Ee][Ff]
*.[Aa][Rr][Ww]
*.[Rr][Aa][Ff]
*.[Oo][Rr][Ff]
*.[Rr][Ww]2
*.[Dd][Nn][Gg]
*.[Hh][Ee][Ii][Cc]
*.[Tt][Ii][Ff]
*.[Tt][Ii][Ff][Ff]
*.[Pp][Ss][Dd]

## JPEG and PNG are deliberately NOT blanket-ignored — the asset catalogue
## needs them for the app icon. Keep local test photographs in these folders
## instead, which are ignored wholesale.
/TestPhotos/
/Fixtures/Photos/

## The Xcode project is generated from project.yml by XcodeGen.
## project.yml is the source of truth; the .xcodeproj is a build product.
*.xcodeproj/
